tags: reverse-search-history vi

=== vi-insert-search-marks-end
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
--- script
add_history "make all"
readline "> "
--- keys
\C-rke\C-j<dump>\r

=== vi-command-search-marks-end
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
--- script
add_history "make all"
readline "> "
--- keys
\e<pause>\C-rmak\C-j<dump>\r

=== vi-search-same-line-keeps-match-mark
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
--- script
readline "> "
--- keys
make\C-rak\C-j<dump>\r
